But sorry, stick with me
here because I'm excited.

00:09:50.604 --> 00:09:53.819
Should we as a collective pay for jabs,

00:09:53.819 --> 00:09:56.141
meaning a non call to action.

00:09:56.141 --> 00:09:59.426
Not buy this wine, but should I create

00:09:59.426 --> 00:10:02.677
an infographic about the tempranillo grape

00:10:02.677 --> 00:10:04.546
and it's just a did you know about...

