and it's just a piece of good content.

00:10:06.520 --> 00:10:08.702
Should a spend three,
four, five hundred dollars

00:10:08.702 --> 00:10:11.743
on getting this awareness
to build up equity

00:10:11.743 --> 00:10:13.996
to then later come in with the right hook.

00:10:13.996 --> 00:10:17.896
I think the answer is predicated
on how much money you have.

00:10:17.896 --> 00:10:20.102
Right, like, if you have a
limited budget, you're probably

00:10:20.102 --> 00:10:22.842
going to want to save it
for, hey buy this wine for

00:10:22.842 --> 00:10:25.744
$14.99, it's a killer for Thanksgiving.

00:10:25.744 --> 00:10:28.020
You know, like, that is
probably what you want

00:10:28.020 --> 00:10:31.375
to save it for, but if you have
an overall marketing budget,

00:10:31.375 --> 00:10:33.615
if you're a bigger brand, if
you're spending real money,

00:10:33.615 --> 00:10:35.774
I think there's enormous value in jabbing.

00:10:35.774 --> 00:10:38.560
I'm spending a ton of money on jabbing

00:10:38.560 --> 00:10:41.393
to build up awareness, to get
people into the ecosystem.

